+    *   If `target_shape` is not `None` (either explicitly set or set by the overflow guard), resample the loaded NumPy array to `target_shape`. The specific interpolation method (e.g., linear, nearest) is not detailed in the sources [S1, unofficial].
+    *   If `downscale_factor` is provided and greater than 1, apply this factor to the original dimensions to determine the target shape, overriding other shape settings if necessary [S1, unofficial].
